  "adaptation_contract": [
    "Use the worker's approach schema as the sole production schema. This spec's family envelopes/anchors are design data; no generic expression evaluator or new planner is requested.",
    "Current station has been built and exact east exits associated; station_roles records the observed native terminal indexes4,3,2,1. Reuse station_leads_input to generate the production lead plan and registry; no guessed frozen entities.",
    "station_leads_input binds all lead endpoints to observed M and rail Z. Remaining local anchors translate by frame.observed_origin; family_envelopes_world gives exact authorised boxes. Later free attachments and native orientation come only from qualified lead/fan/through receipts. Each child retains ordinary version2 fields and1000m horizontal limit.",
    "The current_api_fragments are valid field shapes, but their u/edge/parameter references must be resolved against exact current receipt geometry. Illustrative u values assume a straight u250..900 connection; compute from the actual selected native chain. Do not replay fixed fractions after a split.",
    "Fan parent canonical direction must point toward station for named curve branching. Crossovers use travel tangents at both interior endpoints: with+u parent roads, departure is upper270->lower350; arrival is constructed lower370->upper450 and traversed in reverse. Explicitly inspect canonical direction before using forward flags.",
    "Provide required route bindings containing only edges each movement must traverse. Never require every edge in a whole fan/through receipt containing alternative branches or unused upstream sections. Keep native required_edges<=32.",
    "Target exact ordinary signal subchains after pointwork using receipt topology and endpoint identities. No proximity remap; junction incidence must be revalidated by current native checks. Mid-lead signal parameter and forward flag derive from its refreshed edge orientation.",
    "The15m deck height and selected grade ceiling need native proposal acceptance and profile readback; accepted different segmentation and suitable local displacement are normal outcomes.",
    "Existing named curve references have no direction-reversal field. For fit_variation, ensure the relevant exported chain uses the intended canonical direction and actual contiguous receipt ordering; otherwise use an explicit named interior port with the correct travel tangent, or a narrow adapter extension, never fabricate reversed snapshots.",
    "There are exactly8 bounded construction families. The surveyed shorter branch allows one900m-wide flyover child. Split signalling into inner and outer children to retain the1000m Operator region cap; acceptance is the existing job's check phase.",
    "Bulk signal exclusions suppress placements but do not legalize an internally branching chain. At pointwork, form exact ordinary subchains from the qualified replacement topology. Across the u900 waypoint retain a single300m phase from measured chain lengths, not nominal local-u distances."
  ],
